%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management APIs
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Banking Web App (SPA/React)
    participant API as Youth Account API
    participant AccountSvc as Account Service
    participant TxnSvc as Transaction Ledger Service
    participant DB as Youth Account DB

    Parent->>WebApp: Login (OAuth2)
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (with OAuth2 token)
    API->>DB: Fetch youth account, settings, recent txns
    API->>AccountSvc: Fetch parent/youth account info
    API->>TxnSvc: Fetch recent transactions
    API-->>WebApp: Dashboard data
    WebApp-->>Parent: Render dashboard

    Parent->>WebApp: Fund Transfer
    WebApp->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    API->>AccountSvc: Validate source account, check balance
    API->>DB: Update youth account balance
    API->>TxnSvc: Record fund transfer
    API-->>WebApp: Transfer result
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transfer status

    Parent->>WebApp: Set Spending Limit
    WebApp->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    API->>DB: Update weekly limit
    API-->>WebApp: Limit update result
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show limit status

    Parent->>WebApp: View Transactions
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    API->>DB: Fetch transactions
    API-->>WebApp: List of transactions
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display transactions
